    "created_at": "2016-06-08T13:17:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-08T13:17:12Z",
    "body": "Thanks Anne, I've cleaned it up a bit as discussed. Of note:\n- Just return the selected URL, do not expose getters for the multiple inputs.\n- As input and output are now more obviously asymmetrical (the missing getters on the output) I had to split NotificationAction into a NotificationActionOptions dictionary and a NotificationAction interface.\n- Afaict using an interface with readonly attributes for the output has the happy side effect of not needing to explicitly freeze the action, so I deleted that wrinkle.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
